<ServiceLayout title="Chiropractic Care for Kids" description="Gentle, age-appropriate chiropractic care for children at Frey Clinic of Chiropractic in Napoleon, OH.">

<p>
  Children's spines are developing rapidly, and they face unique physical stresses — from the birth process itself through learning to walk, playing sports, and carrying heavy backpacks. Pediatric chiropractic care helps ensure that their developing bodies have the best foundation for health.
</p>

<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />

<h2>Is chiropractic safe for children?</h2>
<p>
  Absolutely. Pediatric chiropractic adjustments are very gentle — nothing like the adjustments you might picture for adults. The amount of pressure used is often no more than what you'd use to test the ripeness of a tomato. Children typically respond very quickly to care.
</p>

<h2>When should children see a chiropractor?</h2>
<p>Common reasons parents bring their children to our office include:</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc; padding-left:var(--sp-5); margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);">
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Colic or difficulty sleeping</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Ear infections</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Growing pains</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Sports injuries</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Poor posture</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">General wellness and prevention</li>
</ul>

</ServiceLayout>
